    <Box style={{ flex: 9, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14, paddingTop: 4 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#061F32' }}>三层版图 · 一套编码器</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 3, background: '#08A6F6' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#44546A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#061F32' }}>层 10 超导膜</span>：比特十字岛、耦合器、读出腔、控制线与焊盘
      </Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#44546A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#061F32' }}>层 11 Josephson 结</span>：SQUID 环与单结，位置与尺寸参与几何签核
